type: software
title: "Estimating NOx Emissions from Intersection Traffic Video"
abstract: "Pipeline and statistical evaluation comparing video-derived microscopic NOx emission indices (MOVEStar and a MOVES-derived continuous VT-CPFM-inspired formulation) against unweighted and fleet-weighted traffic counts using hourly ambient monitoring data at two Tokyo intersections."
